    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=Analyze this employee performance record.\n\nEmployee ID: {{ $json[\"Employee ID\"] }}\nEmployee Name: {{ $json[\"Employee Name\"] }}\nDepartment: {{ $json[\"Department\"] }}\nAttendance: {{ $json[\"Attendance %\"] }}\nTasks Assigned: {{ $json[\"Tasks Assigned\"] }}\nTasks Completed: {{ $json[\"Tasks Completed\"] }}\nTasks Pending: {{ $json[\"Tasks Pending\"] }}\nQuality Score: {{ $json[\"Quality Score\"] }}\nProductivity Score: {{ $json[\"Productivity Score\"] }}\nManager Feedback: {{ $json[\"Manager Feedback\"] }}\n\nUse the data above to generate the performance report.\n\nReturn ONLY valid JSON:\n\n{\n  \"employee_id\": \"\",\n  \"employee_name\": \"\",\n  \"department\": \"\",\n  \"performance_level\": \"\",\n  \"performance_score\": 0,\n  \"strengths\": [],\n  \"areas_for_improvement\": [],\n  \"summary\": \"\",\n  \"recommendations\": []\n}",
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "You are an Employee Performance Analysis Assistant.\n\nAnalyze employee performance objectively using only the provided data.\n\nEvaluate:\n- Attendance\n- Task completion\n- Pending tasks\n- Quality\n- Productivity\n- Manager feedback\n\nReturn ONLY valid JSON.\n\nUse exactly this structure:\n\n{\n  \"employee_id\": \"\",\n  \"employee_name\": \"\",\n  \"department\": \"\",\n  \"performance_level\": \"\",\n  \"performance_score\": 0,\n  \"strengths\": [],\n  \"areas_for_improvement\": [],\n  \"summary\": \"\",\n  \"recommendations\": []\n}\n\nPerformance level should be one of:\nExcellent\nGood\nAverage\nNeeds Improvement\n\nPerformance score should be between 0 and 100.\n\nDo not include markdown.\nDo not include ```json.\nReturn complete and valid JSON."
        }
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "typeVersion": 3.1,
      "position": [
